Subject: [PATCH] eitd: include ctime declarations

Include the standard declaration of ctime used by the EIT event and section
code.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/eitd/SIevents.hpp   | 1 +
 src/eitd/SIsections.cpp | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/eitd/SIevents.hpp b/src/eitd/SIevents.hpp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/eitd/SIevents.hpp
+++ b/src/eitd/SIevents.hpp
@@ -28,0 +29 @@
+#include <ctime>
diff --git a/src/eitd/SIsections.cpp b/src/eitd/SIsections.cpp
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/src/eitd/SIsections.cpp
+++ b/src/eitd/SIsections.cpp
@@ -27,2 +27,3 @@
 #include <stdio.h>
+#include <ctime>
 #include <unistd.h>
